# When another program deletes the INBOX project while Quick Add is open, Enter adds nothing and the panel says there is no INBOX.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
INBOX:
	- Rake leaves
END
keys q
type Mow
see Quick Add → INBOX
outside <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
hide Rake leaves
keys <Enter>
see No INBOX project in the Navigator
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
